.TH QUOKKA.CONF 5 "2026-11-01" "quokka 2.4.1" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
quokka.conf \- configuration file of quokka
.SH DESCRIPTION
The file is read from the working directory. Each line is
.IB key " = " value .
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B max_entries
The most entries the cache keeps. The default is 64.
.TP
.B retries
How many times a failed sync is tried again. An integer from 0 to 5; larger values are refused. The default is 2.
.TP
.B cache_dir
Where the entries are stored. The default is
.IR .quokka/cache .
